The '''New Republic senatorial complex''', also known as the '''senatorial complex''' or simply the '''Senate complex''', was the facility that housed the [[New Republic Senate|Galactic Senate]] of the [[New Republic]] on [[Hosnian Prime]]. The complex was a vast structure, mostly housed in a single long, flat building one story tall. This had been done to avoid any sense of offices on higher towers being "more prestigious" than others. [[Automated sidewalk]]s were used to ferry people through the expansive complex. The building also featured broad transparent panels along the walls for a view of the outside. Contained within the complex was the [[New Republic Senate conference building|senatorial conference building]], used for a multitude of auxiliary functions, which was [[Napkin Bombing|bombed]] by the [[Amaxine warriors (New Republic Era)|Amaxine warriors]] in [[29 ABY]].<ref name="Bloodline" />

The senatorial complex as a whole was destroyed in [[34 ABY]] when the [[First Order]] used its [[Starkiller Base]] [[superweapon]] to [[Hosnian Cataclysm|destroy]] the [[Hosnian system]].<ref name="Episode VII" />

